<title>FINLAND: Finnish Dec M2 shrinks 2.1 pct yr/yr - Cen Bank.</title>
<headline>Finnish Dec M2 shrinks 2.1 pct yr/yr - Cen Bank.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finland's M2 money aggregate shrunk 2.1 percent year-on-year in December after shrinking 1.2 percent in November, the Bank of Finland said on Thursday.</p>
<p>	     Dec 1996    Change	    Nov 1996     Change</p>
<p>	     (bln mk)     Yr/Yr(pct)     (bln mk)  Yr/Yr(pct)</p>
<p> M1	   204.8	 +16.4		196.6	 +17.2</p>
<p> M2	   297.3	  -2.1		292.3	  -1.2</p>
<p> M3	   325.5	  -1.3		326.5	  -0.5 @</p>
<p>NOTE: M1 comprises currency in circulation, and cheques, giro and transaction accounts. M2 comprises M1 and fixed-term and other bank deposits held by the public.</p>
<p>M3 comprises M2 plus outstanding bank certificates of deposits held by the public.</p>
</text>
